  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell covers your hand with a writhing black aura. As part of casting the spell, you can make a melee touch attack that deals 2d6 points of negative energy damage and causes the target to be staggered for 1 round. If the attack is a critical hit, the target is staggered for 1 minute instead. Creatures immune to precision damage are immune to the staggered effect.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell covers your hand with a writhing black aura. as part of casting the spell, you can make a melee touch attack that deals 2d6 points of negative energy damage and causes the target to be staggered for 1 round. if the attack is a critical hit, the target is staggered for 1 minute instead. creatures immune to precision damage are immune to the staggered effect.\"",
